OL,3,ASignificant drop in levels of toxic
OL,4,A'forever' chemicals in England's rivers
OL,5,
OL,6,FThousands of other forever chemicals,
OL,7,Fknown officially as PFAS, remain in use
OL,8,Fbut the regulator said its report
OL,9,Fshowed the need for them all to be
OL,10,Fbetter monitored and regulated.
